3. Game assets: not included, not licensed, not redistributable
================================================================================

Simitone is an unofficial fan project. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by,
or sponsored by Maxis, Electronic Arts, or The Sims / The Sims Online rights
holders.

Simitone requires the player to supply their own legitimate copy of The Sims:
Complete Collection. The game reads the player's installed .iff, .far, .piff and
texture data at run time; none of it is in this repository, none of it is in
any Simitone build output, and nothing in the licence above conveys or implies
any right to copy, distribute or sublicense it.

The following are deliberately absent from this repository and are ignored by
.gitignore so they cannot be committed by accident:

  SimsCompleteCollectionUSA/   ripped retail disc images (.bin/.cue), 2.6 GB
  mods/                        EA retail expansion/DLC downloads
  Sims1/, "The Sims"/         the player's own game install
  GeneratedMeshes/             scratch meshes derived from the player's data
  FSO.Remeshes-main/, FSO.Remeshes/   the community remesh pack, which is
                               distributed by its own authors under its own
                               terms

If you found game data committed inside this repository, it was committed in
error. Do not redistribute it; remove it.

